Article 71 Where any of the following circumstances exists in violation of the provisions of this Law, the competent authority shall order rectification; if adverse consequences or effects are caused, the leading personnel with responsibility and the directly responsible personnel shall be given sanctions in accordance with law:
(1) Issuing policies and measures without a fair competition review or without passing the fair competition review;
(2) Restricting or excluding private economic organizations in public resource transactions such as bidding and procurement.
